description = "Shoots one of your gold prisms (the one you target, or else your closest). It shatters, dealing {breaker_dmg} Holy damage, plus more for its light ({breaker_full} at full), to all enemies within {breaker_radius} m. Full damage to up to {b:AOE_TARGET_CAP} enemies; with more, that damage is split evenly between all of them."
